<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I marvel that He would descend from His throne divine</l><l>To rescue a soul so rebellious and proud as mine;</l><l>That He should extend His great love unto such as I,</l><l>Sufficient to own, to redeem, and to justify.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I think of His side, pierced and bleeding to pay the debt,</l><l>Such mercy, such love and devotion can I forget?</l><l>No, no! I will praise and adore at the mercy seat,</l><l>And testify all my desires He doth fully meet.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
